@title Lesson walk: build-order-3d (every step, Do it for me or Next)
@area Learn
# Starts the lesson from the palette and plays each step as a learner would: an action step with Do it for me, a reading step with Next. A picture and a layout check after each step.
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text build order
wait 6
click_text "Build order: watch the cabinet go together"
wait 40
shot 01-open-3d
check_layout
try click_text "Do it for me"
wait 30
shot 02-start
check_layout
try click_text "Do it for me"
wait 30
shot 03-next
check_layout
try click_text "Do it for me"
wait 30
shot 04-more
check_layout
try click_text "Do it for me"
wait 30
shot 05-back
check_layout
try click_text "Do it for me"
wait 30
shot 06-last
check_layout
try click_text "Next"
wait 20
shot 07-show-all
check_layout
try click_text "Do it for me"
wait 30
shot end
check_layout
